<<~ ahu slot=`#/meme-header`>>

! The Four Tools Witness Shelf

Source matter moved here.
Invariant reduced elsewhere.
The braid remains recoverable here.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/provenance`>>

!! Provenance

The tight invariant lives at:

* `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/mu/the-four-tools`

This shelf retains the local witness braid behind that compact surface.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/witness-texts`>>

!! Witness Texts

* ''Robert Anton Wilson'' — Chapel Perilous / //Cosmic Trigger// witness.
* ''Camden Benares, Count of the 5s'' — //Common Sense Tarot// witness retained by the Floating Librarians of Mu.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/source-braid`>>

!! Source Braid

RAW supplies the peril:
wand of intuition,
cup of sympathy,
sword of reason,
pentacle of valor,
and the agnostic exit from Chapel Perilous.

The Count of 5s supplies the suit grammar:
Wands for spirit,
Cups for feeling,
Swords for mind,
Pentacles for matter,
Major Arcana for the stronger trump current.

Mu braids these into one carry-set:
four Minor weapons,
one Major return,
one clean preference for model agnosticism over paranoia.

<<~/ahu>>

